# BuildKit uses <dockerfile>.dockerignore (this file) IN PREFERENCE to the context-root
# .dockerignore when building `-f mayhem/Dockerfile`. Upstream's root .dockerignore starts
# with `*` and re-includes only a few dirs (dropping .git AND the fuzz/ crate we build), so
# we override it here to bake in the FULL repo — including .git history (grader / PATCH tier
# need it, SPEC §6.2 item 2) and fuzz/ — dropping only local build artifacts / editor cruft.

# Build outputs / local cruft
**/target/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
